 the one with the better style, as noted by the judges, was determined to be the winner."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The lifting order was different from that used now. The lifters started in the order of their start numbers and could ask for any weight. The next lifters could ask for lower weights. All did their first round of lifts before the next round started."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/28510"} "Unlimited, One Hand, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} " 7 April 1896"] "\n" [:td {} "4"] "\n" [:td {} "3"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/28511"} "Unlimited, Two Hands, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} " 7 April 1896"] "\n" [:td {} "6"] "\n" [:td {} "5"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n7 (7/0)\n"] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n5 (5/0)\n"] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n\n\n" [:h2 {} "Medals"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {:class "top"} [:a {:href "/results/28510"} "Unlimited, One Hand, Men"]] "\n" [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/athletes/69034"} "Launceston Elliot"]] [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/countries/GBR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GBR.png"}] "GBR"]] "\n" [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/athletes/41776"} "Viggo Jensen"]] [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/countries/DEN"} [:im